          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A tawny spotted hyena made from a sphere head, oval body, and four capsule legs. The front legs are slightly longer than the rear to capture the hyena's characteristic sloping back. Dark spots are embroidered in brown yarn after assembly."
          }
